# ==============================================================================
# Docker build context exclusions for the web portal image
# ==============================================================================
#
# This one is load-bearing, not just an optimisation.
#
# web/Dockerfile installs dependencies with `npm ci` and *then* runs `COPY . ./`.
# Without this file that second copy lays the host's macOS node_modules on top
# of the freshly installed Linux ones. esbuild and rollup ship platform-specific
# native binaries, so the mismatch makes `vite build` fail inside the image
# while it still succeeds on the developer's machine — the most confusing
# possible failure mode.

node_modules
dist

# The SPA is compiled with VITE_* values supplied as build arguments. A stray
# .env file would silently override them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.DS_Store
*.log
